Class AIRunService:
- validate operation_context by run_type
- create run metadata with cache keys and optional bound session ownership checks
- short-circuit strong cache hits while still updating transcripts, leaderboard, and metrics
- execute the LangGraph pipeline with model selection, injected baseline/reference/calibration/session context, and optional precomputed tool state
- write ai_runs metadata and artifacts including prompt payloads plus tool traces/facts
- update cache, leaderboard, transcripts, metrics, and structured logs after completion
- expose background streaming execution that first collects tool context, then streams real preview text, then finalizes structured JSON
